      "kind": "display-math",
      "source": " \\begin{aligned}\ns_i &= e^{g_{i-1} - g_i} \\sum_{j=1}^{i-1} e^{x_j - g_{i-1}} + e^{x_i - g_i} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{j=1}^{i-1} e^{x_j - g_i} + e^{x_i - g_i} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{j=1}^{i} e^{x_j - g_i}.\n\\end{aligned} ",
